an":{"start":870,"end":961},"digest":"152a476eb38ac204605f2426a4d04bebf6ecc007fb46ab4e9a397006b713bce5"},{"row":10,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"Unlike other datasets, which are primarily constructed through templated and automated processes,","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":961,"end":1058},"digest":"fa41b08e178169ef3519511bf7a870ebd80103edb8e036c10e1e8dce7925f9af"},{"row":11,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"Dyn-VQA is meticulously curated by humans and requires ongoing human input to maintain the","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1058,"end":1148},"digest":"1f79c7ffb528d70d10df1de7d979b7177b13005d2c76134f3c9860a018f16644"},{"row":12,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"dataset with dynamically updated answers. Consequently, while Dyn-VQA may not match other","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1148,"end":1237},"digest":"dd61519c332dc0fe43cd28b570d14f1c640f91add1987943910b9015b1b1ffbe"},{"row":13,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"datasets in scale, it far surpasses them in terms of quality, difficulty, and the cost of each instance.","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1237,"end":1341},"digest":"252e3e28cb29fc6f39d811825a3cab34dc6141a05ddab63c85fc27b0b02bd350"},{"row":14,"column":0,"colspan":4,"rowspan":1,"text":"More details of Dyn-VQA can be found in Appendix.","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1341,"end":1390},"digest":"b161eae0dd49d6ff9bf0287fec5b135998a4084d2f87ed0561afaa0a2b45e844"},{"row":14,"column":4,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1390,"end":1390},"digest":"1126b9402ddb29e7f169745aefca06c1c77df4bab728b3277e368cb2b5e3e7a3"},{"row":15,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"Dataset Difficulty Questions in Dyn-VQA require more complex external knowledge, whose re-","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1390,"end":1480},"digest":"ff512de0e88e2652be485068abfc183887ab5086ea64b0abed8a12b5562eae12"},{"row":16,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"trieval process is not fixed. The inherent dynamism of Dyn-VQA naturally ensures its difficulty.","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1480,"end":1576},"digest":"1ede800e87664463eec838e3ac61b9b1153b96d52fdb1a1a46e65fd9c2d3ffd7"},{"row":17,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"To illustrate more intuitively, we also conducted a quantitative comparison of human performance","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1576,"end":1672},"digest":"cb698c7d966f41d10798f3256f6d13b2b49a8bf13dd9a434d3b2be9522eb2ed8"},{"row":18,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"on different datasets. As shown in Table 3, the questions in existing VQA datasets can typically be","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1672,"end":1771},"digest":"6f7ad527decf48756849dc2ff5329525cecdf3b600a372d0d66e07b0255f4918"},{"row":19,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"resolved within two reasoning steps, resulting in an average search count of less than 2 per question.","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1771,"end":1873},"digest":"eaf420a644e868144459c1108a2c4fcdc7747b63edee3e891167417da1716add"},{"row":20,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"Besides, image search with textual query is not performed at all in other datasets, since the question","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1873,"end":1975},"digest":"97362547f22cd5be3cf84fabdf65a9a21dbc001bf435d42f269e4491d883222d"},{"row":21,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"therein do not require additional visual knowledge except the textual description of the object in","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":1975,"end":2073},"digest":"ec8a4474a527ab903022e5b571366844265803a838d455109f8e96a6d56ba5db"},{"row":22,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"image. In terms of overall accuracy, humans achieved the lowest performance on Dyn-VQA, further","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2073,"end":2168},"digest":"76b92f7d579a11521673be6f4953e951456badf3e1d4d5b7706b249306c2231a"},{"row":23,"column":0,"colspan":2,"rowspan":1,"text":"demonstrating the challenges it presents.","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2168,"end":2209},"digest":"587508cf88d9b2ede67c8f9fa7813317ba5d7238e75959341b23c61c2e8d6cb4"},{"row":23,"column":2,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2209,"end":2209},"digest":"60417742bd5ffdc97d5deb0c134f4e358a95a9b9388662a02198188a193349b5"},{"row":23,"column":3,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2209,"end":2209},"digest":"38808b270fa6ed5fd65fa229e48f38c899218c5992764ed1c1603c1114dde01f"},{"row":23,"column":4,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2209,"end":2209},"digest":"978b99e9e4ce8edcf48fdafbe0284355cf7d984cc3291ac571abb389c614cb1c"},{"row":24,"column":0,"colspan":4,"rowspan":1,"text":"4 RETRIEVAL BASELINES AND OMNISEARCH","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2209,"end":2245},"digest":"777448640cb1a2231eac07d5c0177e01003f8dc2f9b7d21440ad41aa9b824242"},{"row":24,"column":4,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2245,"end":2245},"digest":"f4c73c8f49155b228c01025df369b9aa576b6b20172fb68fa140dec687539cf0"},{"row":25,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"In this section, we establish several heuristic mRAG baselines and develop our OmniSearch to ad-","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2245,"end":2341},"digest":"f01f1b53ae9616379de04be34e2fe157f51b66d3a26d1b39b59f19f06048b2e4"},{"row":26,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"dress dynamic questions that require complex retrieval. Retrieval tools in all methods are Google-","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2341,"end":2439},"digest":"771ab512f8930816c4626cd6ca380225dca6b7812ecf4607a5f79711e55f86aa"},{"row":27,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"based, including web search (textual web content retrieval with textual queries), image search with","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2439,"end":2538},"digest":"a13be1c2482a218bc6bb208844ff6be569ee9934cfd85e83be5299960d11b869"},{"row":28,"column":0,"colspan":3,"rowspan":1,"text":"input images, and image search with textual query.","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2538,"end":2588},"digest":"c683090c6fa2223cac3368774d0d3bcedb46b0984701bf6a2add5e358b434e77"},{"row":28,"column":3,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2588,"end":2588},"digest":"48db15ae37168bcbfb62752857823b82fdfd80a4b468dfe9d4810891e200c37c"},{"row":28,"column":4,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2588,"end":2588},"digest":"4f6836e6117fdd8af07a9ec2cb7e335ba33a91857aa5884fccdd24f26c1ccbde"},{"row":29,"column":0,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"4.1 BASELINES","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2588,"end":2601},"digest":"65c0d183f6ab29188ddbc0974c08fa027548999fac869bed9c7334c2e3bdbd41"},{"row":29,"column":1,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2601,"end":2601},"digest":"6039e855c0b75ee20a02488f661b9b24b490da95f1bab87d114d17cb4bfda8f6"},{"row":29,"column":2,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2601,"end":2601},"digest":"e1e3d23e54f5bb5d3cca026d5e71bd7df9b47e237fd7d523f5440c4dedc4e484"},{"row":29,"column":3,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2601,"end":2601},"digest":"6892bc6cf0fd4f4c9b3f9cb163ff073347a5a57a2e47a8e71b7d670262265908"},{"row":29,"column":4,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2601,"end":2601},"digest":"849dcf9417469a1eb85bae6244333f47df6f5e48f30ff22650652a229c988296"},{"row":30,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"Single-hop heuristic mRAG baselines. The first heuristic baseline is to retrieve images with","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2601,"end":2693},"digest":"5491b93072f42a08036cc028c333bcfd568c35506b92a105e9fd906f55a6fda7"},{"row":31,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"input images, which provides similar images alongside descriptive captions. This method augments","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2693,"end":2789},"digest":"b9ee6064176be8c0ec2edfc7d9a55b3e90b09f6cab5f837c1aecde9d7cd9c664"},{"row":32,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"MLLMs with visual knowledge about the objects depicted in the input images. Similarly, the second","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2789,"end":2886},"digest":"3b049519421b227df7228aa5ce7dd13ef38e095105eaa2b0dfb52000caeadcc4"},{"row":33,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"heuristic baseline conducts web search with input textual questions and provides MLLMs with","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2886,"end":2977},"digest":"0b38f5b0ba143234a0eaf846699f41dc456d5cf2ec21d96ad063b53b930a676b"},{"row":34,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"the top-k retrieved content as supplementary knowledge. It is acknowledged that these two methods","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":2977,"end":3074},"digest":"718b4d6a3f85e81e53ce57c6be4c1601ee0106ef90456753bbbd3258bbce4a39"},{"row":35,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"may not furnish precise supportive knowledge, since them only leverage partial modality of the input","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3074,"end":3174},"digest":"2bd6ac1fab80e5ccf341d73bfe2a299bc5f7d162d1542d0f33b97c31eff4bb0c"},{"row":36,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"question as search query. Nonetheless, these baselines are still established to explore the benefits","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3174,"end":3274},"digest":"ee5a1ea5d22551e526fe399c47e18a9d581dbcdc721d4d1afcd3cffb7c7ff0db"},{"row":37,"column":0,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"from uni/cross-modality retrieval.","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3274,"end":3308},"digest":"0cb6ce63a2687bfea81a52b9be84e48433035d7e5a954070e63d751e7060d338"},{"row":37,"column":1,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3308,"end":3308},"digest":"999542e1868e6fc4b031c81360e7efd8f0b3715ded7b3e7e23fc38d3adfe841c"},{"row":37,"column":2,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3308,"end":3308},"digest":"67e9a1dcd2f9e931db688e9ee3889438998890d3dbbdabc9400fb544dd54e918"},{"row":37,"column":3,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3308,"end":3308},"digest":"a0f2c1cf117a698508522a7c779077bbdc516448c123132fce144798f454efdc"},{"row":37,"column":4,"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"text":"","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3308,"end":3308},"digest":"b6de47dadfb7d0f75082ff5f00c4f22d3e7d0500ad625e04f59767e5b58e50e8"},{"row":38,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"Two-hop heuristic mRAG baselines. Typically, existing mRAG methods can be generalized into","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3308,"end":3398},"digest":"d8e1df15321db95cfa5187c99a59f952022fae7209ece30b9c22ecf05eec0e14"},{"row":39,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"two primary steps: first, converting the visual concepts in input images into text, and then combining","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3398,"end":3500},"digest":"0b582d08516f18eed28793a04104db7c41c9ff0d6f5c12fa824d61d48f95ebf1"},{"row":40,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"the obtained text with input questions as search queries to retrieve related textual knowledge. For the","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3500,"end":3603},"digest":"5ba1469e0f3b695d6e74b96bb9e864aad64946804f68508c104d99cc616192c0"},{"row":41,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"first step, we employed the caption of the top-1 image retrieved by the input image and the output","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3603,"end":3701},"digest":"02f352ae14f58c169d9afa8ae5b4ffd86b7693b5d8307e934b70a5fb2be4e1bc"},{"row":42,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"of the image caption model as textual representations of the input images, respectively. Subse-","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3701,"end":3796},"digest":"b9fdf17ab101a7ef2c97d06298655f1931899259e012b1d9389d33249b292f56"},{"row":43,"column":0,"colspan":5,"rowspan":1,"text":"quently, the web search API is utilized to extract relevant knowledge from the Internet. Compared","coordinates":null,"span":{"start":3796,"end":3893},"digest":"9af397da9ae62b5